OL,3,GNEWSAFears over 'high risk' crossing
OL,4,Aafter train crash death
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn investigation is continuing into how
OL,7,Fa delivery vehicle and a train collided
OL,8,Fon a crossing, killing a van driver.
OL,10,FThe incident happened off Martin Lane
OL,11,Fand Whitehouse Lane in Burscough, West
OL,12,FLancashire, on Saturday at about 15:00
OL,13,FGMT, when a train from Southport to
OL,14,FManchester collided with what is
OL,15,Funderstood to be a supermarket delivery
OL,16,Fvehicle.
OL,18,FPeople living in the area have told the
OL,19,FBBC that it was not uncommon for the
OL,20,Fgate on the crossing to be left open at
OL,21,Ftimes by people using it.
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,403,400,260,160,0,100
